Alternative: The Extension Route
If you don’t want to mess around with folder paths and extensions code, users on platforms like Reddit suggest a simpler alternative:
1. Host your index.html file online for free using GitHub Pages.
2. Download a lightweight third-party extension like the Custom New Tab Extension on Chrome Web Store.
3. Paste your live GitHub link directly into the extension's options menu.
